WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.943 --> 00:00:09.610
MARK MIRCHANDANI: Welcome to the
Google Cloud Next 2019 showcase

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.180
floor.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.138
NATALIE PIUCCO: We're
super excited to take you

00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:14.720
around all the different
demo areas and neighborhoods

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:15.970
that we have around the floor.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:17.480
MARK MIRCHANDANI: There's
lots of cool stuff down there.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.622
So why don't we show you around?

00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:23.590
[UPBEAT ELECTRO MUSIC]

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.793
There's much great stuff here
at Google Cloud Next 2019.

00:01:14.793 --> 00:01:17.210
We've only begun to scratch
the surface with the showcases

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:17.870
we've shown you.

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:19.680
And there's tons of people
here with high energy.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.260
NATALIE PIUCCO: I know, right.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:23.000
I think there's roughly
around 30,000 people or more

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.320
here actually.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:26.210
Lots of amazing
demo stations where

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:29.500
you can learn about our
Google Cloud Platform.

